---
layout: "base.webc"
title: "2018 January"
id: "201801"
poemTitle: "The New Year"
author: "Eila Webster"
endOfYear: false
---

<div class="full-width">
  <poem-grid
    class="wide-text"
    :title="poemTitle"
    :author="author"
    :theme="bgTheme"
  >
    <!-- Header Section -->
    <div slot="header-tl">
      <img src="/poems/2018-january/image-14.avif" alt="" />
    </div>

    <div slot="header-tr">
      <img src="/poems/2018-january/image-14.avif" alt="" />
    </div>
    <!-- Column 1 Images (15%) -->
    <div slot="col-1-images">
      <img src="/poems/2018-january/image-1.avif" alt="" />
      <img src="/poems/2018-january/image-10.avif" alt="" />
      <img src="/poems/2018-january/image-12.avif" alt="" />
    </div>

    <!-- Column 2 Text -->
    <div slot="col-2-text">
      <p>
        As the old year fades away, <br />
        Another comes fresh and new; <br />
        We wonder what it will hold, <br />
        But it really is up to you.
      </p>

      <p>
        Do you welcome it with open arms, <br />
        Full of exciting vim and vigour; <br />
        You’re the one at the helm, <br />
        Being ready to pull the trigger.
      </p>

      <p>
        Or do you sit down and moan, <br />
        To shiver in the winter cold; <br />
        Stop feeling sorry for yourself, <br />
        Just get up and dance – be bold.
      </p>
    </div>

    <!-- Column 3 Middle Images -->
    <div slot="col-3-images">
      <img src="/poems/2018-january/image-4.avif" alt="" />
      <img src="/poems/2018-january/image-6.avif" alt="" />
      <img src="/poems/2018-january/image-8.avif" alt="" />
    </div>

    <!-- Column 4 Text -->
    <div slot="col-4-text">
      <p>
        You can be active all your life, <br />
        Don’t let your body rot; <br />
        You’ll be surprised and happy, <br />
        If you use the strength you’ve got.
      </p>

      <p>
        In later years use a cane, <br />
        To dance with it makes sense; <br />
        It is there to give you support, <br />
        And you’ll gain confidence.
      </p>

      <p>
        Go and make your resolutions now, <br />
        This will make your moments sweet; <br />
        Making sure this will be the year, <br />
        That will keep you on your feet.
      </p>
    </div>

    <!-- Column 5 Images (15%) -->
    <div slot="col-5-images">
      <img src="/poems/2018-january/image-3.avif" alt="" />
      <img src="/poems/2018-january/image-9.avif" alt="" />
      <img src="/poems/2018-january/image-11.avif" alt="" />
    </div>
  </poem-grid>
</div>
